Package: kasn
Type: Package
Title: Kolmogorov-Arnold Sieve Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sami", "Abdurahman", email = "you@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: R interface to the 'kasn' Python package, which implements
    Kolmogorov-Arnold Sieve Networks (KASN). A KASN is a sieve extremum
    estimator built from a deep Kolmogorov-Arnold network with learned
    B-spline edges, Group Lasso regularisation on the edge coefficients and
    an adaptive pruning rule. It targets nonparametric regression with many
    covariates under weak (mixing) dependence.
